.TH BUFFER_BROTLI 3
.SH NAME
buffer_brotli \- create a Brotli compression/decompression buffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <buffer.h>
.P
.BI "int buffer_brotli(buffer* " b ", buffer* " other ", int " compress ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR buffer_brotli ()
wraps a Brotli (de)compression stream around an existing buffer
.IR other .
If
.I compress
is non-zero, it initializes an encoder with the given quality level;
otherwise, it initializes a decoder.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 1 on success, 0 on failure.